     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Constant-pivot preprocessing for the gauged K=16 order charts.
     3	
     4	This program performs only quotient-ring isomorphisms of the following form.
     5	If a current equation is
     6	
     7	    f = a*x + b,        a in Q^*,        x not in b,
     8	
     9	then it deletes ``f`` and ``x`` and substitutes ``x = -b/a`` in every other
    10	equation.  No polynomial, parameter, or chart-dependent leading coefficient
    11	is inverted.  Rows are visited from the largest h-adic power down, with the
    12	original coefficient-variable order breaking ties.  The rule is therefore
    13	deterministic.
    14	
    15	The emitted Singular programs retain the empty/nonempty wrapper controls, an
    16	independent actual-pair Jacobian control, and the Rabinowitsch equation
    17	``T*c-1``.  This script PREPARES those programs; it never invokes Singular.
    18	"""
    19	
