   167	Numerically, `u_3*2-v_3=3*2-8=-2`; multiplying by
   168	`n/d_3,(-mu_1)/d_3,(-mu_2)/d_3=(9,6,5)` gives the orders
   169	`-18,-12,-10`.  Thus the powers and orders come from the tower data rather
   170	than from the printed corners.
