+This is the requested finite-support joint construction: both local charts are
+images of the **same** coefficient arrays in (2.1), and (2.8), not a local ODE,
+contains the actual Jacobian equation. Before local-centre variables and a
+Rabinowitsch wrapper, its global ambient has exactly 7161 unknowns. Branch 2
+adds `(u,rho)` and branch 52 adds `(u,v,c)`; the torus slices remove `rho` or
+`c` respectively.
