+
+```text
+sigma_52(s,pi)=u*s^2+v*s^4+pi*s^5,
+p=pi(pi^2-c), c!=0,
+s^9 F(s^-2,sigma_52)=p^9+O(s),
+s^6 G(s^-2,sigma_52)=p^6+O(s).                           (2.6)
+```
+
+The three packets are `9+9+9` for `F`, `6+6+6` for `G`, and `5+5+5` for
+`T2`. Xu's degree-40 leader is `q=p^10 q1`; in monic gauge
