+This is the base finite-support global major/minor-leader/Jacobian incidence
+construction: both local charts are images of the **same** coefficient arrays
+in (2.1), and (2.8), not a local ODE, contains the actual Jacobian equation.
+It is not yet the complete requested Moh/Xu joint system because the effective
+root bridge described below is absent. Before local-centre variables and a
+Rabinowitsch wrapper, its global ambient has exactly 7161 unknowns. Branch 2
+adds `(u,rho)` and branch 52 adds `(u,v,c)`; the torus slices remove `rho` or
