   458	D_s(Q,h)+2s^2 h^4=0,       D_s(Q,h)=Q_s h_pi-Q_pi h_s.   (3.5)
   459	```
   460	
   460	
   461	At `n=1` (`s^-1`), its only nonzero cokernel condition is
