+|---|---:|---:|
+| `delta=2`, before minor rows | 23 | 7118 |
+| `delta=2`, after leader | 5 | **7100** |
+| `delta=5/2`, before minor rows | 24 | 7119 |
+| `delta=5/2`, after leader | 4 | **7099** |
