+| 3 | 39 | `30 / 25` | 24 | 4 | 41 |
+| 4 | 37 | `29 / 24` | 22 | 5 | 51 |
+| 5 | 35 | `28 / 23` | 22 | codimension 5 | **59** |
+| 6 | 33 | `27 / 22` | 20 | 17 remainder rows | **OPEN** |
