+digests was retyped. Every new `(99,66)` Python driver repeats the same
+receipt-derived check internally. No ledger, `jc2-lean`, `ideation-*` file, or
+named in-progress lane report was read or edited.
+
+Work is over characteristic zero. Exact computations use `Q` or a displayed
+localization of it; the coefficient constructions base-change to the intended
