+```text
+E_n=sum_(r+s=n)((18-s)f_r' g_s+(r-12)f_r g_s')-cJ*[n=31]. (3.3)
+```
+
+Its banked ledger is:
+
+| band | new unknowns | raw / quotient rows | new rank | old compatibility | dimension incl. `rho`, fixed `cJ` |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
