+| branch/stage | `h3,h2+centre` dimension | plus 6600 untouched outer variables |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| major `h3/h2`, before a minor centre | 120 | 6720 |
+| `delta=2`, before minor rows | 122 | 6722 |
