+  has 169 coefficients (`3r+4q>=97`). Thus this projected `D2` block has 392
+  scalar rows. Recentring by (2.3) adds seven independent rows below `e^296`,
+  distributed `1,1,1,2,2` at powers `291,292,293,294,295`, leaving 162.
