+Because the 396 major `h2` pivots use only `C2,C3`, projection of the
+120-dimensional major family onto its 21 `h3` coordinates is surjective. The
+minor ranks therefore add exactly to this triangular block. The four outer
+blocks `A2,A3,B1,B2` contain 6600 still-untouched global variables. The joint
