+The free dimension is 162. Every row is rechecked under the triangular map; a
+zero positive point passes and perturbing one pivot fails. This is the
+independent `PROJECTED-MAJOR-h2-D2-D1` audit.
+
+The simultaneous approximate-root calculation then supplies the correction
+(2.3a): three of the nominal `D2` slots are identities, while 389 `D2` and
+seven `D1` rows pivot only `C2,C3`. Its dimension 120 and free 21-coordinate
+`h3` projection are what justify the joint counts in the preceding table. This
+still stops before the outer `F,G` order blocks, either direct minor `F,G`
