+### 2.2 What Lemma 2.1 does—and does not—supply
+
+Moh's Lemma 2.1 is a Laurent-coordinate restriction, not an `(x,y)` Newton
+polygon. In the orientation of this report, take
+
+```text
+F=eta^-99,
+G=eta^-66+sum_i gamma_i(x) eta^i.
+```
