+Its leading forms are exactly
+
+```text
+in h3=P,          in h2=P^3,
+in F=P^9=y^27(y-x)^72,       in G=P^6=y^18(y-x)^48.       (2.2)
+```
+
+This simultaneously records the 27/18 principal-minor multiplicities at
+`y=0` and 72/48 major multiplicities at `y=x`.
