+```text
+21 h3 variables + 187 C2 variables + 308 C3 variables = 516.
+```
+
+Among the 392 projected `D2` output slots, three are exact approximate-root
+identities at `(r,q)=(1,23),(1,22),(2,22)`. The remaining 389 rows have a
