+
+[`major_h2_probe.py`](/home/ubuntu/jc2/box/g9966-20260903/major_h2_probe.py)
+builds the 169 strict coefficients in the invertible basis
+`t^r(w-1)^q`, substitutes (2.3), and extracts every scalar row below `e^296`.
