+### 3.3 `delta=5/2`: common leader and ODE through `s^28`
+
+Substitute `t=s^2`, `w=u*s^4+v*s^6+pi*s^7` in the same (3.1), kill the
+coefficients below `s^21`, and set `[s^21]K3=p`. There are 20 rows and 20
