+### 3.2 `delta=2 [2,1]`: the common `h3` leader
+
+In (3.1) substitute `w=u*t^2+t^3*z` and require
+`K3=p2*t^9+O(t^10)`. Exact constant-pivot elimination gives:
+
+| minor `t` band | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 | 7 | 8 | 9 |
