+| direct minor raw-row count | [`minor_row_count.py`](/home/ubuntu/jc2/box/g9966-20260903/minor_row_count.py), [`JSON`](/home/ubuntu/jc2/box/g9966-20260903/minor_row_count.json) | 1,647 / 1,910 rows; no rank claim | 1.19 s, 18,528 KiB |
