+| object in this report | source object | degree | principal-minor multiplicity |
+|---|---|---:|---:|
+| `F` | Xu/Moh `g` | 99 | `99*3/11 = 27` |
+| `G` | Xu/Moh `f=T1` | 66 | `66*3/11 = 18` |
+| `T2` | `T2` | 55 | `55*3/11 = 15` |
+| `T3` | `T3` | 145 | `(145-2)*3/11+1 = 40` |
