+sigma_2(t,z)=u*t+z*t^2,                  p2=z^2(z+3*rho), rho!=0,
+t^18 F(t^-1,sigma_2)=p2^9+O(t),
+t^12 G(t^-1,sigma_2)=p2^6+O(t).                          (2.4)
+```
