+The cheapest genuinely new test is the exact next system in section 3.4:
+continue the degree-162 Jacobian at `[x^135 y^27]`, add pole rows
+`F_(95,*)/G_(62,*)`, and impose the matching outer-`F,G` `D1` major band, using
