+Thus `F` has packets `18+9`, `G` has packets `12+6`, and `T2` has packets
+`10+5`. The necessary degree-40 `T3` leader is
+
+```text
+R=z^25(z+3*rho)^14(z-2*rho),
+2*p2*R'-25*p2'*R=k*p2^14.                               (2.5)
+```
