+| `D2`, base `h3` | after exact `h3`-adic reduction, `ord F_j>=-j/3`, `ord G_j>=-j/3`; the canonical `F_1=0` |
+| `D2`, base `h2` | redundant checks `ord A2>=-2`, `ord A3>=-3`, `ord B1>=-1`, `ord B2>=-2` |
