+| block | `H` | `C2` | `C3` | `A2` | `A3` | `B1` | `B2` | total |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| fixed top | 66 | 187 | 308 | 1650 | 2739 | 561 | 1650 | **7161** |
+
+As an audit, before fixing the homogeneous forms the corresponding counts are
