+| 6 | 33 | `27 / 22` | 20 | 17 remainder rows | **OPEN** |
+
+This table and the fact that `cJ` first appears only at band 31 are sourced at
+[`moh9966-B-lift...md:293`](/tmp/jc2-lane.eijAga/inputs/moh9966-B-lift-sol56-20260903.md:293).
