+# The joint two-infinity system for `(99,66)`
+
+Date: 2026-09-03 UTC  
+Producer: Codex `g9966-global-design-sol56-20260903`  
+Frozen basis: `afb7e21be9164e6fed9748614361f51db26e1410`  
