+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| `h3` | 11 | 8 | `-1/3` | — | not defined there |
+| `h2` | 33 | 24 | `-1` | 8 | `-1/9` |
+| `F` | 99 | 72 | `-3` | 24 | `-1/3` |
+| `G` | 66 | 48 | `-2` | 16 | `-2/9` |
