+| solved `n` | ODE powers | new variables per level | rows / pivots | nonzero old compatibility | dimension at `c=1` |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1 | `s^-1` | 19 | `21 / 19` | `c_(11,0)=0` | 3 incl. `b0` |
+| 2–6 | `s^0...s^4` | 19 | `21 / 19` | 0 | 3 incl. `b0` |
+| 7–30 | `s^5...s^28` | 19 | `21 / 19` | 0 | **3 incl. `b0`** |
