+| commuting stage | cumulative rank | `delta=2` dimension | `delta=5/2`, `b0=0` dimension |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| common-`h3` base | 0 | 6704 | 6702 |
+| six direct pole rows | 6 | 6698 | 6696 |
+| first Jacobian row | 6 | 6698 | 6696 |
