+### 4.1 Moh's `(64,48)` parent / reduced `(16,12)` kill
+
+For `s=3,u_s=1`, the trivial minor side adds no variables or rows. Dividing the
+parent degrees by 4 gives Moh's p.208 `(16,12)` chart. Both readings were tested:
