+c_(7,4)=c-3u^2v, c_(10,1)=-cv.                          (3.4)
+```
+
+Now write `h=p/s+sum A_i s^i` from that same finite global `h3`, and
+`Q=q1+sum_(n>=1) B_n s^n`. The reduced Xu equation is
+
+```text
+D_s(Q,h)+2s^2 h^4=0,       D_s(Q,h)=Q_s h_pi-Q_pi h_s.   (3.5)
+```
